('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'Startup Pitch: B2B Networking, Founders & Investors', 'Tablon Partners closes out the year with a B2B pitch and networking night at Candela Bar in Brickell. It is listed as sold out, so join the waitlist.', 'Candela Bar Brickell', NULL, 'Brickell', 'Pitch Nights & Demo Days', '2026-12-31', '18:00', 'Sold out (waitlist)', 'https://www.eventbrite.com/e/startup-pitch-b2b-networking-founders-investors-miami-tickets-1979704931743', 3),
